# Cookie Chain public RPC. Defaults to https://rpc.cookiescan.io if unset —
# see docs/research/ECOSYSTEM.md and poc/RESULTS.md for how this was confirmed.
NEXT_PUBLIC_COOKIE_CHAIN_RPC=https://rpc.cookiescan.io

# Sponsor Service signing key (server-only, never exposed to the client —
# see src/app/api/claim/route.ts and src/lib/program/sponsor.server.ts).
# A JSON array of secret key bytes, same format `solana-keygen` writes to a
# keypair file, e.g.: SPONSOR_SECRET_KEY=[12,34,...]
# NEVER commit a real value here. This wallet needs a real COOK balance on
# whatever cluster NEXT_PUBLIC_COOKIE_CHAIN_RPC points to.
SPONSOR_SECRET_KEY=
